<div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr"><div class="main-page-tag-lcs main-page-tag-lcs-exploded"><div class="lcs-container"><center id="Intro" class="Mainpage-border">
<div class="Mainpage-header">Welcome to the Genshin Impact Wiki!</div>
<figure class="mw-halign-center" typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/Genshin_Impact" title="Genshin Impact"><img alt="Genshin-Impact-Logo" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="300" height="114" class="mw-file-element lazyload" data-image-name="Genshin-Impact-Logo.png" data-image-key="Genshin-Impact-Logo.png" data-relevant="1" data-src="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/2/2a/Genshin-Impact-Logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20230708061611" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<p><a href="/wiki/Genshin_Impact" title="Genshin Impact">About</a> • <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external text" href="https://genshin.hoyoverse.com">Official Website</a> • <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external text" href="https://www.hoyolab.com/home">HoYoLAB Community Forums</a> • <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external text" href="https://genshin.hoyoverse.com/en/news">Official News</a> • <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external text" href="https://genshin.hoyoverse.com/en/manga">Manga</a>
</p><p><i><b><a href="/wiki/Genshin_Impact" title="Genshin Impact">Genshin Impact</a></b></i> is an open-world action RPG developed and published by <a href="/wiki/HoYoverse" class="mw-redirect" title="HoYoverse">HoYoverse</a> for the PC, iOS/Android, PS5, and Xbox Series X|S platforms.<br />The game is free-to-play with a <i>gacha</i> monetization system in the form of <a href="/wiki/Wishes" class="mw-redirect" title="Wishes">Wishes</a>.<br />
This wiki is an English resource for information about the global version of the game. There are <b>unmarked spoilers</b> on this wiki.<br />
This wiki currently has <a href="/wiki/Special:Statistics" title="Special:Statistics"><b>38,350 articles</b></a> and <a href="/wiki/Special:Statistics" title="Special:Statistics"><b>319,732 files.</b></a>
</p><p><b><big>Please read the <a href="/wiki/Special:Community" title="Special:Community">Community Page</a> and <a href="/wiki/Genshin_Impact_Wiki:Community_Rules" title="Genshin Impact Wiki:Community Rules">Rules</a> before editing and discussing!</big></b>
</p>
</center>
